      "title": "Client & Route Adapters",
      "items": [
        "React 19 SPA with ClarificationCard, ScopeInsufficientCard & HITL Approval Modal",
        "Thin Express route adapters (POST /api/query, POST /api/voice, POST /api/query/approve)",
        "Audio ingestion and Whisper STT decoupled at the intake boundary"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deep Execution Engine",
      "items": [
        "Unified QueryExecutionEngine core eliminating legacy fallback blocks and duplicate zombie pipelines",
        "Deterministic + LLM Ambiguity Gate with anti-injection schema allowlisting",
        "Per-connection Schema Profiler (bounded TTL cache) & tenant-scoped Few-Shot memory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Safety & Storage",
      "items": [
        "Human-in-the-Loop write interception with 10-minute signed approvalToken",
        "Atomic single-use JTI replay prevention via MongoDB approval_tokens unique index",
        "Dual database isolation: application metadata decoupled from external user DBs"
      ]
